{"id":"sinon","lemma":"sinon","pos":"conj","rank":462,"glosses":["except, apart from","if not","otherwise, or else"],"ipa":"/si.nɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/26/Fr-sinon.ogg/Fr-sinon.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Plus vite, sinon tu seras en retard.","en":"Hurry up, or you will be late.","words":[{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"quickly"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"late, overdue"]]},{"text":"Il lit rarement, sinon jamais.","en":"He seldom, if ever, reads a book.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"bed"},{"g":"rarely, seldom"},null,{"g":"never"}]},{"text":"Reste calme, sinon le bébé va se réveiller.","en":"Be quiet, or the baby will wake up.","words":[{"g":"rest, remainder"},{"g":"calm"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"baby"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to awaken"}]},{"text":"Ferme-la. Sinon, tu seras viré.","en":"Shut up. If you don't, you'll be thrown out.","words":[{"g":"to shut","l":"fermer"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"to bear, veer","l":"virer"}]},{"text":"Tu ferais mieux de cracher l'argent, sinon...","en":"You'd better cough up the money, or else.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"better"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to spit"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"money"},null]}]}